  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-06-03T12:55:23.819Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Impostor avatars are ugly, low detail, and worst of all, can look DRASTICALLY different from the normal avatar. I have a personal OC avatar with a maid dress, and the impostor is COMPLETELY broken. The only thing I can do about this is repeatedly delete and regenerate the impostor and HOPE it fixes it, but with another avatar it changed the color of the avatar's clothing to something that doesn't match the rest of the model.",
